Ternary charts
&emsp;
&emsp;

Summary: This example shows how to create ternary charts in F#.
Let's first create some data for the purpose of creating example charts:
open Plotly.NET

// a coordinates
let a = [ 1; 2; 3; 4; 5; 6; 7 ]

// b coordinates
let b = a |&gt; List.rev

